{"id":"sh/ah0ju58n","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":68,"top":182,"width":328,"height":110},"text":"Confirmed structured memory","style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#123D34","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/xkr250re","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":420,"top":182,"width":786,"height":112},"text":"Only diet, walking bound and category allowlists can persist. Explicit user confirmation, owner/group scope and optimistic version checks. Raw notes are not saved.","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#365148","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/cji1wfqt","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":68,"top":327,"width":328,"height":110},"text":"A real process replacement","style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#123D34","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/rm50r69o","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":420,"top":327,"width":786,"height":112},"text":"The recording terminates the serving process, starts another boot and signs in again. Saved vegetarian / 6000m preferences and the same approval return.","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#365148","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/qlwji1sj","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":68,"top":472,"width":328,"height":110},"text":"A separate human authority","style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#123D34","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/gruhs761","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":420,"top":472,"width":786,"height":112},"text":"Decision binds owner, proposal SHA-256, revision and expiry. Commit reconstructs costs and writes one ledger in a transaction; replay cannot duplicate it.","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#365148","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
